6. **Memory Management**: The code includes cleanup logic to free allocated memory after use, preventing memory leaks.

7. **Scalability**: Designed to handle up to 10,000 geometries efficiently both in terms of time complexity (single pass initialization) and space complexity (minimal allocations).

