This code initializes a memory pool of nodes and handles concurrent access using mutex locks. It manages CRC indication structures with a custom allocation strategy to avoid duplicates based on `RNTI`. The solution is designed for efficiency and thread safety, leveraging static memory to handle up to 10,000 elements without dynamic allocation per entry. Error handling ensures graceful behavior when the pool is exhausted.']

